  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f395e524722d44617a6d4bfd8d66ee5c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ox Killer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterDetailsInspector
  karmicMerit: 68
  isTengu: 0
  Destination: 0
  introLines:
  - character_text: Oh, Boddhisattva Jizo, please spare me!
    baseSprite: {fileID: -2685202389345621323, guid: 826dfebe57c5341fb94314da88fc5f54, type: 3}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  finalLines:
  - character_text: I have told you my life story, and now you know why I am here.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - character_text: ' I may have once worshiped false gods, and violated the Buddhist precepts in their name, but I have done everything within my power to mend my foolish ways!'
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  hellLines:
  - character_text: ' ....I understand, Boddhisattva. I never should have worshiped Chinese gods in the first place. '
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  humanLines:
  - character_text: 'I shall! My dedication to Buddhism in my first life will pale in comparison to my next. Thank you, Boddhisattva Jizo! '
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  heavenLines:
  - character_text: Thank you, thank you, THANK YOU, most glorious, wonderful Boddhisattva! I promise you will not regret this decision.
    baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
    mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  CharacterNodes:
  - key: IntroductionText
    value:
      character_text: I may have worshiped false gods early on, but I promise you I have mended my ways!
      nodeID: IntroductionText
      answers:
      - answer_text: False gods? What are you talking about?
        nextID: familytothrive
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: familytothrive
    value:
      character_text: Oh, Boddhisattva Jizo! I foolishly spent the first part of my life worshipping Chinese gods....
      nodeID: familytothrive
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: familytothrive2
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: familytothrive2
    value:
      character_text: They told me I must sacrifice an oxen every year if I wanted my family to thrive....
      nodeID: familytothrive2
      answers:
      - answer_text: Sacrifice an oxen!
        nextID: violationofprecepts
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: violationofprecepts
    value:
      character_text: ' I know....to kill any animal is clearly a  violation of Buddhist precepts.'
      nodeID: violationofprecepts
      answers:
      - answer_text: ...
        nextID: hearmeout
      - answer_text: "But it sounds like you weren\u2019t Buddhist at the time..."
        nextID: buddhisttemple
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: hearmeout
    value:
      character_text: Yes, this is why I stand before you now.
      nodeID: hearmeout
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: hearmeout2
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: hearmeout2
    value:
      character_text: But I promise I have mended my ways! If you only hear me out, I promise I can explain everything.
      nodeID: hearmeout2
      answers:
      - answer_text: (It seems I won't get any more information here.)
        nextID: violationofprecepts
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 1
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: buddhisttemple
    value:
      character_text: ' I was not. But this has changed! '
      nodeID: buddhisttemple
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: buddhisttemple2
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: buddhisttemple2
    value:
      character_text: 'My home has now become a glorious Buddhist temple, and I have saved hundreds upon hundreds of animals from captivity. '
      nodeID: buddhisttemple2
      answers:
      - answer_text: ...Perhaps arrogance was the trait that landed you here?
        nextID: arrogancelandedyouhere
      - answer_text: How did you go from sacrificing oxen to saving them?
        nextID: dreamaboutcows
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: arrogancelandedyouhere
    value:
      character_text: Oh, pardon me! I just tend to get a little excited about my conversion to Buddhism
      nodeID: arrogancelandedyouhere
      answers:
      - answer_text: (It seems I won't get any more information here.)
        nextID: buddhisttemple2
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 1
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: dreamaboutcows
    value:
      character_text: Well, I once grew terribly sick...and then I had a dream! About cows!
      nodeID: dreamaboutcows
      answers:
      - answer_text: Cows?
        nextID: respectanddignity
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: respectanddignity
    value:
      character_text: Yes, cows! I was sitting in a field filled with oxen.
      nodeID: respectanddignity
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: respectanddignity2
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: respectanddignity2
    value:
      character_text: Then, one of them approached me and licked my cheek.
      nodeID: respectanddignity2
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: respectanddignity3
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: respectanddignity3
    value:
      character_text: I have never felt so welcomed, so at peace.
      nodeID: respectanddignity3
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: respectanddignity4
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: respectanddignity4
    value:
      character_text: I finally realized that the oxen I had been sacrificing were no mindless beasts, but beings deserving of respect and dignity.
      nodeID: respectanddignity4
      answers:
      - answer_text: Took you long enough...
        nextID: secondchangeending
      - answer_text: And what did you do once you woke up?
        nextID: onceyouwokeupending
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: secondchanceending
    value:
      character_text: ...Once again, I apologize, O great Boddhisattva.
      nodeID: secondchanceending
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: secondchangeending2
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: secondchanceending2
    value:
      character_text: In an effort to make up for my foolishness, I spent the remainder of my life saving every animal I could from captivity.
      nodeID: secondchanceending2
      answers:
      - answer_text: '[Keep listening]'
        nextID: secondchangeending3
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 0
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: secondchanceending3
    value:
      character_text: I know the sin I committed was unforgivable, but please consider giving me a second chance.
      nodeID: secondchanceending3
      answers:
      - answer_text: (It seems I won't get any more information here.)
        nextID: respectanddignity4
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 1
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - key: ending
    value:
      character_text: I converted to Buddhism, and spent the rest of my life saving every animal I could.
      nodeID: ending
      answers:
      - answer_text: (It seems I won't get any more information here.)
        nextID: IntroductionText
      markedGrey: 0
      isALastNode: 1
      CountsTowardsEnding: 1
      baseSprite: {fileID: 0}
      mouthSprite: {fileID: 0}
  caseFile:
    characterName: Ox Killer
    characterAge: 93
    karmicMerit: 68
    reasons: A rich and powerful lord who once sacrificed oxen in the name of Chinese gods, after suffering from an intense bout of sickness, he converted to Buddhism and spent the rest of his life saving animals from captivity.
